<title>UK: NatWest slips on results, trading statement.</title>
<headline>NatWest slips on results, trading statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Westminster Bank Plc slipped in pre-market dealings after the bank posted slightly appointing results and a cautious trading statement, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0810 GMT, the shares were down 15p to 797-1/2p.</p>
</text>
